{"synopsis":"\\[ Suatu hari, seekor wyvern terbang di langit.\nMelihatnya, aku memutuskan untuk pension. ]\n\nAster, seorang trouble-shooter dari keluarga penyihir bangsawan Dekulan, yang berasal dari latar belakang gelandangan sialan.\n\nIa melarikan diri demi kebebasan, namun akhirnya tertangkap dan kehilangan nyawanya.\nNamun, saat membuka mata, ia telah kembali ke masa ketika dirinya masih seorang gelandangan di zona hitam-putih!\n\n\"Aku akan membangun perpustakaan yang dulunya menjadi impian rekan-rekanku. Tidak, lebih dari itu. Aku akan membangun sebuah menara!\"\n\n\"Dan sebagai bonus, buku rahasia keluarga Dekulan akan dipajang di lantai satu.\"\n\nKehidupan kedua Aster dimulai kembali dari dunia gelandangan!","alternative_title":"뒷골목 마법사의 회귀생활","author":"Kim Dak heu, Kairos","artist":"Dohan","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c8877625-d608-4731-aeda-811ce1afb432","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-05-21","released":"2026-05-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c4f70425-9e77-436a-bd3d-9c40c97fcc21","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-05-06","released":"2026-05-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"73f17509-120c-4411-a32a-c26adcf975bf","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-05-03","released":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"dcb400b6-2a78-4c77-81d2-8f88bfd63df5","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-04-23","released":"2026-04-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"8fe98810-5229-4eec-890b-44ac8a8a2503","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-04-14","released":"2026-04-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2d63f4de-a784-43d4-b159-9fa17f4109a0","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-04-10","released":"2026-04-10","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"856bb0cb-d591-43f5-b4b7-d0eabfdefa9f","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-03-31","released":"2026-03-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1d553ce0-28c7-4f40-bd30-3e42090abd62","n